  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 最短距离",
    "title": "三棱锥 $P$-$ABC$ 满足 $AB=2\\sqrt{3}$，二面角 $P$-$AB$-$C=\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}$，已知 $PC\\perp AB$，$PA+PB=4$，$CA-CB=2$，求 $PC$ 长度的最小值",
    "answerLabel": "$PC$ 长度的最小值",
    "answerValue": "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{54 - 6 \\sqrt{57}}}{4}$"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "建系并把条件翻译成轨迹",
      "content": "<p>把底面 $ABC$ 放在水平面 $z=0$，以 $AB$ 为 $x$ 轴、中点为原点：</p>$$A(- \\sqrt{3}, 0, 0),\\quad B(\\sqrt{3}, 0, 0),\\quad AB=2\\sqrt{3}.$$<p>$PC\\perp AB$，故 $P$、$C$ 横坐标同为 $s$。$C$ 在底面 $z=0$ 上，$P$ 在 $z>0$。$P$、$C$ 到 $AB$ 的垂足同为 $F(s,0,0)$。</p><p>$A$、$B$ 为焦点，$PA+PB=4$，故 $P$ 在以 $AB$ 为轴的旋转椭圆上：</p>$$\\dfrac{s^2}{4}+d_P^2=1\\quad(|s|<2).$$<p>$CA-CB=2$，故 $C$ 在以 $A$、$B$ 为焦点、靠近 $B$ 的双曲线上：</p>$$s^2-\\dfrac{d_C^2}{2}=1\\quad(s>1).$$<p>两轨迹同时成立要求 $s\\in(1,2]$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Len_AB",
        "Plane_ABC",
        "Line_PC",
        "Point_F",
        "Point_P",
        "Point_C"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 9.43,
        "y": 7.1,
        "z": 9.89
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "二面角化为垂面内的夹角",
      "content": "<p>垂直于棱 $AB$ 的平面上，二面角 $P$-$AB$-$C$ 等于 $\\angle PFC=\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}$。</p><p>在 $\\triangle PFC$ 中，$PF=d_P$，$CF=d_C$，$\\angle PFC=\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}$，余弦定理得</p>$$PC^2=d_P^2+d_C^2-d_P d_C.$$<p>把椭圆、双曲线代入：</p>$$d_P=\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{s^2}{4}},\\qquad d_C=\\sqrt{2(s^2-1)},$$$$PC^2=\\dfrac{7}{4}s^2-1-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sqrt{4-s^2}\\sqrt{s^2-1}.$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Plane_PAB",
        "Plane_CAB",
        "Plane_PFC",
        "Line_PC",
        "Point_F",
        "Point_P",
        "Point_C",
        "Len_PF",
        "Len_CF"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 14.28,
        "y": 5.18,
        "z": 3.61
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "对参数 $s$ 求最小值",
      "content": "<p>令 $f(s)=PC^2$，$s\\in(1,2]$。求导并令 $f'(s)=0$，得唯一驻点</p>$$s^2=\\dfrac{95-7\\sqrt{57}}{38}\\in(1,4).$$<p>该点满足 $7\\,d_P d_C=5-2s^2$。代回 $f(s)$ 并化简：</p>$$PC^2=\\dfrac{3(9-\\sqrt{57})}{8}.$$<p>端点处：$s\\to 1^+$ 时四面体退化；$s=2$ 时 $PC=\\sqrt{6}$ 更大。故驻点给出最小值。</p><p>因此 $PC_{\\min}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{3(9-\\sqrt{57})}{8}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{54 - 6 \\sqrt{57}}}{4}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Line_PC",
        "Point_P",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_F",
        "Len_PF",
        "Len_CF"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
